+
+\The MOS reinitialises standard and extended vectors before issuing reset
+\service calls. Do not restore WiCFS predecessor vectors here: doing so can
+\overwrite a filing system which has already reclaimed its vectors in this reset
+\pass. Only discard the persisted WiCFS ownership record.
+.wicfs_reset
+	PHP
+	PHA
+	TXA
+	PHA
+	TYA
+	PHA
+	LDA	#0
+	STA	wicfs_magic
+	STA	wicfs_magic+1
+.wicfs_reset_done
+	PLA
+	TAY
+	PLA
+	TAX
+	PLA
+	PLP
+	RTS
 \OSFILE metadata return complete
 
